{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15859","headline":"送归中丞使新罗册立吊祭 · 吉中孚","name":"送归中丞使新罗册立吊祭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"官称汉独坐，身是鲁诸生。\n绝域通王制，穷天向水程。\n岛中分万象，日处转双旌。\n气积鱼龙窟，涛翻水浪声。\n路长经岁去，海尽向山行。\n复道殊方礼，人瞻汉使荣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吉中孚","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15859.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15859","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}